{"id":"sanctorale.09-22.german-speaking","source":"santos/santos_sep#0922","kind":"sanctoral","items":[{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"[In den Diözesen deutscher Sprache]"}]]}]},"part":"title","role":"rubric"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"h2","lines":[["22. September"],["Hl. Mauritius und Gefährten, Märtyrer"]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[["Nach einem Bericht aus dem 5 Jh. war Mauritius Kommandant der sogenannten Thebäischen Legion; diese Legion, bestehend aus etwa 6600 Mann, war in der ägyptischen Thebais rekrutiert worden und bestand hauptsächlich aus Christen. Als die Legion sich weigerte, den Göttern Roms zu opfern, wurde sie zuerst dezimiert und dann in der Nähe von St. Maurice (Wallis) niedergemacht. Das war vermutlich um 285."]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Commune-Texte für Märtyrer:"}],[{"m":"link","t":"1","to":"common.martyrs.1"},{"m":"link","t":"2","to":"common.martyrs.2"},{"m":"link","t":"3","to":"common.martyrs.3"},{"m":"link","t":"4","to":"common.martyrs.4"},{"m":"link","t":"5","to":"common.martyrs.5"}],[{"m":"rubric","t":"."}]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Tagesgebet"]]}]},"part":"collect"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[["Herr, unser Gott, du hast dem heiligen Märtyrer Mauritius und seinen Gefährten die Kraft gegeben, dem Glauben an Christus treu zu bleiben. Gib auch uns den Mut, dir mehr zu gehorchen als den Menschen. Darum bitten wir durch Jesus Christus."]]}]},"part":"collect"},{"slot":"141","text":{"la":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Præfatio"]]}],"pt-BR":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefácio"]]}],"en-US":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Preface"]]}],"es":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefacio"]]}],"it":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefazio"]]}],"fr":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Préface"]]}],"de":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Präfation"]]}]},"part":"preface","suggested":true},{"slot":"142","text":{"la":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"De sanctis martyribus"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Quóniam beáti mártyris N. pro confessióne...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... Quóniam tu magnificáris in tuórum...","to":"preface.55"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"pt-BR":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Dos Santos Mártires"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"...O sangue que o Santo Mártir N. derramou...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"...Vós sois exaltado quando celebramos os santos...","to":"preface.55"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"en-US":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"HOLY MARTYRS"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... For the blood of your blessed...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... For you are glorified when your Saints...","to":"preface.55"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"es":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Santos Mártires"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Porque la sangre del glorioso mártir...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"...Porque tú eres ensalzado en la alabanza de tus santos...","to":"preface.55"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"it":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"DEI MARTIRI"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... A imitazione del Cristo tuo Figlio...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"fr":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Des Martyrs"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Nous reconnaissons un signe éclatant de ta grâce...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... En louant tes saints martyrs,...","to":"preface.55"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"de":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"MÄRTYRERN"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"...Im Martyrium des (der) heiligen N. ...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}]},"part":"preface","suggested":true}],"precedence":12.0,"prefaces":["preface.54","preface.55"],"commons":["common.martyrs.1","common.martyrs.2","common.martyrs.3","common.martyrs.4","common.martyrs.5"],"title":{"*":"Hl. Mauritius und Gefährten, Märtyrer"}}
